---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SubNav from '../components/SubNav.astro';
import SubFooter from '../components/SubFooter.astro';

const description =
  'Now City Inc. is a small, bootstrapped team designing and building complete neighborhoods: walkable, green, and made to improve with time.';
---

<Layout title="About Us" description={description}>
  <SubNav current="/about" />

  <section class="pt-12 md:pt-16">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl leading-tight text-forest-700 md:text-5xl">A small team, building for the long now.</h1>
      <p class="lede mt-6">Now City Inc. designs and builds complete neighborhoods: walkable, green, and made to improve with time. We are a small, bootstrapped team, and we intend to stay with what we build, tending it for decades rather than years.</p>
      <p class="prose-body mt-6">The full argument for why lives in <a href="/manifesto">the manifesto</a>. The short version: the way America builds is failing the people it is for, the fixes already exist, and someone has to pull them together into real places. That is the work.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <a href="/team" class="block rounded-md border border-stone-100 bg-cream-50 p-7 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-copper-400/50">
          <p class="eyebrow">The People</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl text-forest-700">Meet the team →</h2>
          <p class="prose-body mt-3 !text-[15px]">The founders and the senior advisors whose craft this work stands on.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/manifesto" class="block rounded-md border border-stone-100 bg-cream-50 p-7 no-underline transition-colors hover:border-copper-400/50">
          <p class="eyebrow">The Why</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl text-forest-700">Read the manifesto →</h2>
          <p class="prose-body mt-3 !text-[15px]">Cities are humanity's largest technology, and they are due for an upgrade. The full argument.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-section bg-cream-50">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">How We Show Up</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl text-forest-700 md:text-4xl">Six values.</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-md border border-stone-100 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-lg text-forest-700">Cultivate Curiosity</h3><p class="prose-body mt-2 !text-[15px]">Where are the healthiest, happiest people and places in the world, and what can we learn from them? We chase the answers.</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-stone-100 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-lg text-forest-700">Catalyze Creativity</h3><p class="prose-body mt-2 !text-[15px]">Creativity is imagination in action: how we learn, grow, and solve what nobody else has solved yet.</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-stone-100 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-lg text-forest-700">Be Courageous</h3><p class="prose-body mt-2 !text-[15px]">Walk a mile in someone else's shoes, face the hard challenges, and act for the good of the whole.</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-stone-100 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-lg text-forest-700">Develop Diversity</h3><p class="prose-body mt-2 !text-[15px]">Because it is right, and because it works: diverse communities of people, species, and ideas are healthier and more alive.</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-stone-100 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-lg text-forest-700">Build Trust</h3><p class="prose-body mt-2 !text-[15px]">Trust is how a team, a neighborhood, and a partnership stay coordinated. Transparency builds it, and we choose it.</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-md border border-stone-100 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-lg text-forest-700">Begin Regeneration</h3><p class="prose-body mt-2 !text-[15px]">Sustainable holds the line. Regenerative makes things better than we found them. We are here for repair, renewal, and growth.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="prose-body mt-8">If you are a landowner, a city, or a capital partner, the company side of this work lives at <a href="https://nowcity.co">nowcity.co</a>. If you might live in a place like this, you are why it exists.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SubFooter />
</Layout>
